{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"accusations\": [\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Thenaisie等，PMID:36070366，STN-DBS、步态及冻结（FOG）期间神经活动研究\",\n      \"pmid\": \"36070366\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"将Thenaisie等的研究描述为4人研究，并在结构化证据记录中将样本量记为n=4。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原始论文总体纳入18名帕金森病患者。4人可能是实际进行冻结事件分析的子集，但报告没有区分总体队列人数与实际FOG分析人数，容易使读者误以为整项研究只有4名患者。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"PMID:39470410，帕金森病及FOG相关研究（具体题名未提供）\",\n      \"pmid\": \"39470410\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"结构化证据记录将该研究的样本量标记为未报告（n: 摘要未报告），并注明信息依据为摘要。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原始论文全文明确报告20人同意参加、18人入组，最终12人进入统计分析。报告未提取全文已有的最终分析样本量，导致证据记录不完整。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Beaudoin等，2026年Shannon entropy研究；Thenaisie等，PMID:36070366\",\n      \"pmid\": \"36070366\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.64898/2026.08.13.744293\",\n      \"report_says\": \"报告将2026年Shannon entropy研究与Thenaisie既有4人队列的数据重复使用描述为已经确认的事实，并据此认定不能将其计为新的独立患者队列。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"现有文献证据不足以确认两项研究使用了相同的4名参与者或相同原始数据集。Thenaisie原始论文总体纳入18人，4人可能只是实际FOG分析子集。没有参与者编号、数据集来源或原始数据对应关系，不能将队列重叠视为已确认事实，只能标记为疑似或无法确认。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8ceee311-a61b-409c-9324-34ad6a69b7d3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T124928233747Z", "elapsed_seconds": 28.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T12:49:56.524391+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "30d682b0f8e1a9f5f1e92fc27ee1111cddf14ff50254ffc97eaeaa567a3bdd27", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T124928233747Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "2a42c7eb2215b1cb0555916c721dcee8be4c146948b14801c0e68ed789d61c25"}}}
